# megadungeon's knobs, for reference - it takes no templates at all:
#   width, height             the grid it carves (forced odd). Default 60x60.
#   room_tries                how many times it tries to drop a room in. Default 1266.
#   min_room_size             the smallest room edge. Default 5.
#   room_ratio                how far from square a room may be, 0 = square. Default 0.25.
#   straight_passage_chance   how strongly a corridor keeps its heading. Default 0.5.
#   imperfect_connect_chance  how often it adds a second way between two regions, making loops. Default 0.5.
#   door_distance             how far apart two doorways must be. Default 5.
#   dead_ends                 true keeps dead-end corridors. Default false: they are filled back in.
#   min_rooms                 regrow until the level has at least this many rooms. Default 10.
